          "title": "Ici, d'ailleurs...",
          "summary": "Ici, d'ailleurs... (\"Here, in fact...\" in French) is an independent record label based in Nancy, France and established by Stéphane Grégoire in 1997 from his associative label \"Sine Terra Firma\". It is mainly involved with production, publishing, booking and pressing.",
